  calls:
  - day: 1
    caller: "M\xFCd\xFCr (telefon)"
    lines:
    - "Alo? Hay\u0131rl\u0131 olsun, ilk g\xFCn\xFCn. K\u0131sa anlatay\u0131m, m\xFCteahhitler
      kap\u0131da."
    - "Binalar bitti, aileler ta\u015F\u0131nmak i\xE7in isk\xE2n bekliyor. Lafa
      de\u011Fil k\xE2\u011F\u0131da bak: solda y\xF6netmelik, sa\u011Fda k\xFCnye
      ve ek rapor."
    - "K\xFCnyeye bir m\xFCh\xFCr basars\u0131n. Onay bin be\u015F y\xFCz lira har\xE7,
      aileler ta\u015F\u0131n\u0131r. Red s\u0131f\u0131r, bina bo\u015F kal\u0131r.
      Perde ekle bin lira, g\xFCnde bir kere."
    - "Kasan bo\u015F ba\u015Fl\u0131yor, kira her ak\u015Fam kesilir. Kitapta yazmayan
      kusura tak\u0131lma. Kolay gelsin."
  - day: 4
    caller: "M\xFCd\xFCr (telefon)"
    lines:
    - "Alo, benim. \u0130yi misin, evdekiler iyi mi?"
    - "\u015Eehir hasar tespitiyle u\u011Fra\u015F\u0131yor. Bakanl\u0131k kitaba
      yeni madde ekledi: hasarl\u0131 binalar."
    - "Uzmanlar daha b\xFCy\xFCk bir deprem bekliyor. Onar\u0131m izinlerine dikkatli
      bak."
  - day: 6
    caller: "M\xFCd\xFCr (telefon)"
    lines:
    - "Alo, benim. Belediye kasas\u0131 bug\xFCn kapal\u0131, har\xE7 al\u0131nm\u0131yor."
    - "Yani bug\xFCn m\xFCh\xFCrler sana para getirmez. Ama aileler yine ta\u015F\u0131nacak,
      karar\u0131n yine ge\xE7erli."
    - Radyo da hep deprem diyor. Dikkatli bak.
  news:
  - day: 1
    headline: "Uzmanlar b\xF6lgedeki fay hatt\u0131na dikkat \xE7ekiyor"
    ticker:
    - "AFAD: Her evde su, fener ve d\xFCd\xFCk olan bir deprem \xE7antas\u0131 bulunsun"
    - "Hava: par\xE7al\u0131 bulutlu, 14\xB0"
    graphicLabel: FAY HATTI
    graphic: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 007806ca1b3aedc42a2d2b203327b5b6, type: 3}
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - day: 2
    headline: "Depremde yaralanmalar\u0131n \xE7o\u011Fu devrilen e\u015Fyadan"
    ticker:
    - "Uzmanlar: Uzun dolaplar\u0131 ve kitapl\u0131klar\u0131 duvara sabitleyin"
    - "Belediye: \u0130sk\xE2n ba\u015Fvurular\u0131 bu hafta h\u0131zland\u0131r\u0131l\u0131yor"
    graphicLabel: "DOLABI SAB\u0130TLE"
    graphic: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3818c5677a4f33544a9580812a4665a6, type: 3}
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - day: 3
    headline: "D\xFCn \xF6\u011Fleden sonra hafif bir sars\u0131nt\u0131 hissedildi"
    ticker:
    - "Uzmanlar tedirgin: sars\u0131nt\u0131lar s\xFCrebilir"
    - "AFAD: Deprem an\u0131nda \xE7\xF6k, kapan, tutun"
    graphicLabel: SARSINTI
    graphic: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6d3a679a458b6fd40874d5644660451b, type: 3}
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - day: 4
    headline: "D\xFCnk\xFC depremin ard\u0131ndan hasar tespit \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmalar\u0131
      s\xFCr\xFCyor"
    ticker:
    - "Uzmanlar art\xE7\u0131 depremlere kar\u015F\u0131 uyard\u0131"
    - "K\u0131z\u0131lay: \xC7ad\u0131r kentte yard\u0131m noktalar\u0131 a\xE7\u0131ld\u0131"
    graphicLabel: "HASAR TESP\u0130T\u0130"
    graphic: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ab4770e435e380e4185c5b7610d57a97, type: 3}
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - day: 5
    headline: "Hasarl\u0131 binalara girilmemesi \xE7a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131 yap\u0131ld\u0131"
    ticker:
    - "Uzmanlar daha b\xFCy\xFCk bir deprem olas\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131ndan s\xF6z
      ediyor"
    - "Belediye: Onar\u0131m izni ba\u015Fvurular\u0131 s\xFCr\xFCyor"
    graphicLabel: "HASARLI B\u0130NA"
    graphic: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a02227c26b134a547a229c802309a8dd, type: 3}
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - day: 6
    headline: "Son iki g\xFCnde onlarca sars\u0131nt\u0131 kaydedildi"
    ticker:
    - "Vatanda\u015Flar tedirgin"
    - "AFAD: Deprem \xE7antan\u0131z\u0131 kap\u0131n\u0131n yan\u0131nda tutun"
    graphicLabel: "ART\xC7I"
    graphic: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 91aa83b435f030d4596095871d9c2d7b, type: 3}
    clip: {fileID: 0}
